---
/**
 * PIN → local keys → username NFT passport → sponsored actions.
 */
---

<figure class="concept-diagram" aria-labelledby="onboard-sponsor-caption">
  <div
    class="onboard-flow"
    role="img"
    aria-label="PIN creates local keys. Claim username mints an NFT passport. Sponsored actions use app-wide or squad gas pools via EIP-7702."
  >
    <ol class="onboard-steps">
      <li class="onboard-step">
        <span class="onboard-step-num">1</span>
        <span class="onboard-step-title">Set a PIN</span>
        <span class="onboard-step-body">Nostr and Ethereum keys are created locally and encrypted on device</span>
      </li>
      <li class="onboard-step">
        <span class="onboard-step-num">2</span>
        <span class="onboard-step-title">Claim a username</span>
        <span class="onboard-step-body">Mints an NFT — your gas-sponsorship passport</span>
      </li>
      <li class="onboard-step">
        <span class="onboard-step-num">3</span>
        <span class="onboard-step-title">Act on-chain</span>
        <span class="onboard-step-body">EIP-7702 sponsors gas for eligible Pacto actions</span>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="sponsor-tiers">
      <div class="sponsor-tier sponsor-tier--global">
        <span class="sponsor-tier-label">App-wide pool</span>
        <span class="sponsor-tier-body">Global sponsorship for eligible members and protocol actions</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sponsor-tier-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</div>
      <div class="sponsor-tier sponsor-tier--squad">
        <span class="sponsor-tier-label">Squad pool</span>
        <span class="sponsor-tier-body">Each squad can deploy its own sponsor from the app</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="onboard-sponsor-caption" class="concept-diagram-caption">
    An embedded cross-network wallet plus sponsorship means the user never has to buy ETH just to
    start. Crypto stays under the hood.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
